<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντι-λάμπω</span></b> , inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λάμπην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					3.6
				</span></i>
			:—<i>light up in turn,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δ᾽ ἀντέλαμψαν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ φύλακες</span>) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				294
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>reflect light, shine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν σελήνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arat.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			; of the rainbow, <i><span class="en">
				Anaxag.
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shine opposite to</i> or <i>in the face of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἥλιος ἀ. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			,etc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				27.4
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>dazzle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ἀκροάτῃ λέξις ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
				</span></i>
			
			
			<i><span class="en">
				2.41c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>vie in brilliance with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
